    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The circles with centres G1 and G2 cross at U1 and U2. Draw a straight line through U1 and U2. Draw a circle with centre T1 and radius OE. It crosses the circle with centre G2 at W1 and W2. Draw a straight line through W1 and W2. Turn both new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
