    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "The line from S2 to S4 crosses the circle with centre F1 at J, to the right. Draw a vertical line through J. It crosses the horizontal line at J1. Keep the compass open to OE. Draw circles with centres J1 and J2 in turn. Each circle crosses the horizontal line to the right at J2 and J3. Draw a vertical line through each of J2 and J3. Turn the three new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
