    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Keep the compass open to OE. Draw circles with centres A and N in turn. Each circle crosses the horizontal line to the right at N and M1. Draw a circle with centre G2 and radius OA. It crosses the horizontal line at M2 and M3. Draw a line through each of M1, M2 and M3 at 90° to line OE. Turn the three new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
